WEBVTT

00:00:58.162 --> 00:01:00.412
Aur vo jo baatacheet ke 
doosare paksh me hain

00:01:00.412 --> 00:01:02.246
mere paas bhee kuchh
salaah hai

00:01:02.246 --> 00:01:05.913
apane sahakarmee ko kaise
sunen aur smaarthan karen

00:01:05.913 --> 00:01:08.538
Main aapako bilkul nahin 
bata sakata ki kya kahana hai

00:01:08.538 --> 00:01:10.371
kyonki vo tumhaare
hone chaahie

00:01:10.371 --> 00:01:12.996
Kyonki main nahin jaanata ki 
aap kya paristhi mein hai

00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:14.163
Lekin jo bhee ho

00:01:14.246 --> 00:01:15.913
mujhe aasha hai ki ye
sujhaav

00:01:15.913 --> 00:01:18.621
aapako vahee bahato mein
madad karenge jo

00:01:18.621 --> 00:01:20.204
kahana chaahate hain

00:01:20.204 --> 00:01:23.746
Aapako pata hona chaahie ki 
aap kya chaahate hain

00:01:23.746 --> 00:01:25.579
Apane aap se poochho

00:01:25.579 --> 00:01:27.204
kya mujhe vyati se kuchh
chaahie

00:01:27.204 --> 00:01:29.246
jo main is baare mein 
baat kar raaha hoon?

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:31.246
Main kahaan jaana chaahata hoon,